              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32.35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok obalo Topet, ma onoŋo tye i nota pa wod pa Kinom, wek dano mo pe dok owaŋ iye wode nyo nyare ki mac me gityer bot jok Molek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok omuko lwak cal aguragura ma yam luker me Juda gudyero bot cen, ka ma gidonyo kwede i ot pa Rwot, i ŋet kicika pa Natan-melek, dano ma gikolo ma tiyo i ot pa kabaka, ma i dyekal me ot pa Rwot; ka owaŋo gadigadi pa cen ki mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Luker 21.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek 33.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak keno tyer ma yam obedo i wi kicika ma malo me ot pa Akaj, ma yam luker me Juda gutiyo, kacel ki Reno tyer ma yam Manace ocano i dyekal aryo ducu me ot pa Rwot, magi ducu omuko oreto woko piny, oŋido woko matitino, oonyo lurugi i nota me kulu Kidron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 11.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok obalo waŋ jogi ma i wi godi ma yam gitye i ŋet Jerucalem yo tun wokceŋ, yo tuŋ acuc me got me bal, ma en aye got Jeituni, ma yam Solomon kabaka me Icrael ogero pi Acitoret ma jok kipyeda pa jo Cidon, ki pi Kemoc ma jok kipyeda pa jo Moab, ki pi Milkom ma jok kipyeda pa jo Ammon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok oturo wir jogi ducu oŋido woko, ka otoŋo yadi ma gicomo pi woro Acera ma jok ma dako-ni, ka opoŋo kabedogi ki cogo kom dano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
